    <string name="onboarding_0_title">Meet Specty</string>
    <string name="onboarding_0_body">A quality lab for your music. Look inside any audio file and see what it really contains.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_1_title">See the spectrum</string>
    <string name="onboarding_1_body">The spectrogram shows every frequency over time. Open it fullscreen, pinch to zoom into the top end and touch it to read exact values.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_2_title">Catch fake lossless</string>
    <string name="onboarding_2_body">A lossless file made from an MP3 keeps the MP3\'s cutoff. Specty finds that edge, says how sure it is and which encoder it resembles.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_3_title">Measure everything</string>
    <string name="onboarding_3_body">Loudness, true peak, dynamic range, clipping and stereo health, plus a background scan of your whole library. It all runs on your device.</string>
